{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The polygon(s) formed by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/2/c627c273f075e2a88f879f81a0cd64208eaa799c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=3x+2, y=-3x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"191\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/d/1ad33aeaf069ca6ae0a40f4cf7b9188a985624be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />, is (are):\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab35620ae8d5ee2166969d55224a468b72215e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\text{An equilateral triangle}\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }\\text{an isosceles triangle} \\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\text{a right triangle} \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D) }\\text{a triangle and a trapezoid}\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }\\text{a quadrilateral}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"588\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/1/dd16f75588387485bf90ad49243dd1b8144894f9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]import graph; size(10.22 cm); real lsf=0.5; pen dps=linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10); defaultpen(dps); pen ds=black; real xmin=-4.2,xmax=4.2,ymin=-4.2,ymax=4.2;  pen cqcqcq=rgb(0.75,0.75,0.75), evevff=rgb(0.9,0.9,1), zzttqq=rgb(0.6,0.2,0);   /*grid*/ pen gs=linewidth(0.7)+cqcqcq+linetype(&quot;2 2&quot;); real gx=1,gy=1; for(real i=ceil(xmin/gx)*gx;i&lt;=floor(xmax/gx)*gx;i+=gx) draw((i,ymin)--(i,ymax),gs); for(real i=ceil(ymin/gy)*gy;i&lt;=floor(ymax/gy)*gy;i+=gy) draw((xmin,i)--(xmax,i),gs);  Label laxis; laxis.p=fontsize(10);  xaxis(xmin,xmax,defaultpen+black,Ticks(laxis,Step=1.0,Size=2,NoZero),Arrows(6),above=true); yaxis(ymin,ymax,defaultpen+black,Ticks(laxis,Step=1.0,Size=2,NoZero),Arrows(6),above=true); clip((xmin,ymin)--(xmin,ymax)--(xmax,ymax)--(xmax,ymin)--cycle);  dot((0,2),ds); dot((1.333,-2),ds); dot((-1.333,-2),ds); draw((0,2)--(1.333,-2)--(-1.333,-2)--(0,2));  [/asy]\" width=\"485\" height=\"485\" />\n</p><p>The points of intersection of two of the lines are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e0ef68f274ec95f4a8f94eebff49accdcf689ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/9/d092f3522d5898c5c1c38cdc5167eca6bb97e3dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\pm \\frac{4}{3} , -2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"71\" height=\"37\" />, so use the Distance Formula to find the sidelengths.\n</p><p>Two of the side lengths are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa023e0403051afc3ca4cb8120ba5c0e540d3481.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{(\\frac{4}{3})^2+4^2} = \\frac{4 \\sqrt{10}}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"164\" height=\"45\" /> while one of the side lengths is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  That makes the triangle isosceles, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1960 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1960\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_P